module

public import PolyData.Vanish.G.Maps

@[expose] public section

/-!
Check 1 of `check_trace --polymaps` in the kernel for 1 relators shared by the presentations
['c66_Rk15_m14_0', 'c66_Rk45_m14_0', 'c66_Rk56_m14_0'] (set `G`; generated by `poly_to_lean.py vanish`). The relators are
